    "section": "09. Movement Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "09.07.01",
    "summary": "A Desperate Escape Test refers to the full set of Hazard Rolls for that escape option. When a Fall-Back Move uses this option, apply any test penalty across those rolls. In the Bloodletters example, Bane of Cowards gives a Battle-shocked unit a −1 on each Hazard Roll when it falls back from them by that route.",
